cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below and give the date you downloaded it."
type: dataset
title: "Self-Driving Incidents Explorer"
abstract: >-
  An open dataset of crashes, near misses, police stops and court cases in which a vehicle's
  automated-driving feature is claimed, questioned or confirmed to be involved. One case per
  incident, built from published reports, with coded variables, supporting quotations and source links.
authors:
  - name: "CrimConsortium"
    website: "https://crimconsortium.com"
url: "https://selfdriving.crimconsortium.com/"
repository-code: "https://github.com/CrimConsortium-CrimRxiv/self-driving-incidents"
license: CC-BY-4.0
keywords:
  - self-driving cars
  - automated driving
  - criminology
  - open data
